    "color": "#64748b",
    "description": "The first stage of the flow: somebody being drip-worked, with no money attached. There is deliberately no money field of any kind here — a price box on a prospect invites a guess, and a funnel total built from guesses is worse than no total. The drip is a checklist of six touches feeding a progress bar, and Next touch drives the calendar that is this app's main screen. Something to bid is the gate out: tick it and the prospect is promoted to Leads, where money attaches as an estimate. The two hand-off buttons install without a destination — a bundle cannot name an app id in a workspace it has never seen — so pick Leads and Nurturing once after installing.",
